VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api

# task-telemetry-web — CRM telemetry SDK opt-in switch (docs/superpowers/specs/
# 2026-07-24-crm-telemetry-design.md). Strict opt-IN: the SDK no-ops unless this
# is EXACTLY "on" — leave unset/off for dev and the E2E stack (spec §3: "выключен
# в dev по умолчанию и в E2E"). Prod build sets VITE_TELEMETRY=on via a build-arg
# (devops follow-up — see task-telemetry-web PR body).
VITE_TELEMETRY=off
